    "text": "Input QUEUED to agent-b's console (terminal t1, control c2). This is NOT confirmation: it proves only that the bytes were written to the PTY, not that the runtime acted on them. Read the console with comms_console_tail and check whether the draft is still at the prompt before assuming it worked — and do not retry blind, a repeated Enter has been observed to change nothing.",
